{"source": "/home/ubuntu/shiva-study-set/Shiva Sutras 1.11.mp3", "engine": "faster-whisper-base", "segments": [{"t": 0.34, "end": 4.34, "text": "Shakti chakra-sandhana-atvikshu-sama-haryana,"}, {"t": 4.34, "end": 9.71, "text": "the one who has destroyed this whole universe"}, {"t": 9.71, "end": 14.71, "text": "by meditating on the collective meal of energies,"}, {"t": 14.71, "end": 16.71, "text": "Sautant."}, {"t": 16.71, "end": 19.71, "text": "And by that,"}, {"t": 19.71, "end": 24.71, "text": "the one who has achieved"}, {"t": 24.71, "end": 28.71, "text": "the state of the expansion state of Turya,"}, {"t": 28.71, "end": 30.71, "text": "who is aware of the Apta-atma-kham,"}, {"t": 30.71, "end": 34.71, "text": "who covers all-round oneness of God consciousness,"}, {"t": 34.71, "end": 37.71, "text": "everywhere, in Jagrath-in-Supanat-in-Susha-Shakti,"}, {"t": 37.71, "end": 39.71, "text": "in Turya also."}, {"t": 39.71, "end": 42.71, "text": "So, Tad-Dharajarohin,"}, {"t": 42.71, "end": 47.71, "text": "by that yogi,"}, {"t": 47.71, "end": 49.71, "text": "Tad-Dharajarohin,"}, {"t": 49.71, "end": 55.1, "text": "when he ascends"}, {"t": 55.1, "end": 58.1, "text": "and gets established"}, {"t": 58.1, "end": 60.1, "text": "in that spring,"}, {"t": 60.1, "end": 64.1, "text": "summit of Turya."}, {"t": 64.1, "end": 67.1, "text": "Turya-atitam-puruhtam-chaitanyam-avisham."}, {"t": 67.1, "end": 69.1, "text": "He enters, he gets,"}, {"t": 69.1, "end": 71.1, "text": "he enters,"}, {"t": 71.1, "end": 74.1, "text": "and gets the entry of Turya-atitam."}, {"t": 74.1, "end": 76.1, "text": "Turya-turya-atitam."}, {"t": 76.1, "end": 79.54, "text": "He just said,"}, {"t": 79.54, "end": 80.54, "text": "in this sutra,"}, {"t": 80.54, "end": 82.54, "text": "Tretai-bhokta-vire-shah."}, {"t": 82.54, "end": 88.62, "text": "The one who eats,"}, {"t": 88.62, "end": 104.55, "text": "enjoys all the three states of Jagrath-supanat-susha-Shakti."}, {"t": 104.55, "end": 106.55, "text": "She is Vire-shah."}, {"t": 106.55, "end": 109.55, "text": "Vire-shah, he becomes Vire-shah,"}, {"t": 109.55, "end": 113.55, "text": "the master of all organic energies,"}, {"t": 113.55, "end": 117.55, "text": "not organic organs."}, {"t": 117.55, "end": 122.55, "text": "There are two glasses of organs."}, {"t": 122.55, "end": 124.55, "text": "One is organic organs."}, {"t": 124.55, "end": 127.55, "text": "One is organic energies."}, {"t": 127.55, "end": 129.55, "text": "Organic organs are those organs"}, {"t": 129.55, "end": 131.55, "text": "which are found everywhere,"}, {"t": 131.55, "end": 134.55, "text": "in each and every individual being."}, {"t": 134.55, "end": 137.55, "text": "And organic energy is found only in yogis,"}, {"t": 137.55, "end": 140.55, "text": "because they are always aware of,"}, {"t": 140.55, "end": 142.55, "text": "when they see,"}, {"t": 142.55, "end": 144.55, "text": "when they get touched,"}, {"t": 144.55, "end": 145.55, "text": "when they smell,"}, {"t": 145.55, "end": 147.55, "text": "when they hear,"}, {"t": 147.55, "end": 149.55, "text": "when they produce sound,"}, {"t": 149.55, "end": 152.86, "text": "when they talk,"}, {"t": 152.86, "end": 154.86, "text": "they are always aware."}, {"t": 154.86, "end": 156.86, "text": "So, their organic energies"}, {"t": 156.86, "end": 159.86, "text": "are not organic organs."}, {"t": 159.86, "end": 162.86, "text": "They are organic energies."}, {"t": 162.86, "end": 164.86, "text": "Indra-Shaktis."}, {"t": 164.86, "end": 167.86, "text": "In other words, these are called Indra-Shaktis."}, {"t": 167.86, "end": 171.86, "text": "Those are called Indra-yivritis."}, {"t": 171.86, "end": 173.86, "text": "Yes."}, {"t": 173.86, "end": 178.53, "text": "Vire-shah means,"}, {"t": 178.53, "end": 183.53, "text": "he becomes master of those organic energies."}, {"t": 183.53, "end": 185.53, "text": "So, this and Vire,"}, {"t": 185.53, "end": 187.53, "text": "this and join this threefold state."}, {"t": 187.53, "end": 190.53, "text": "This is not the same enjoyment that a worldly person has."}, {"t": 190.53, "end": 192.53, "text": "No, no, no."}, {"t": 192.53, "end": 195.53, "text": "This is enjoying the oneness of these three states,"}, {"t": 195.53, "end": 198.53, "text": "you know, Turya."}, {"t": 198.53, "end": 202.53, "text": "When you enjoy the oneness of these three states and Turya,"}, {"t": 202.53, "end": 206.53, "text": "you become the master of all viras,"}, {"t": 206.53, "end": 209.53, "text": "of all heroes."}, {"t": 209.53, "end": 211.53, "text": "Who are heroes?"}, {"t": 211.53, "end": 214.53, "text": "Active, organic energies."}, {"t": 214.53, "end": 218.53, "text": "Active, organic energies are called heroes."}, {"t": 218.53, "end": 222.94, "text": "Organic, not organic thoughts."}, {"t": 222.94, "end": 225.94, "text": "Organic energies."}, {"t": 225.94, "end": 227.94, "text": "This is not the same thing as K-3,"}, {"t": 227.94, "end": 228.94, "text": "both we do."}, {"t": 228.94, "end": 229.94, "text": "No."}, {"t": 229.94, "end": 233.94, "text": "This is the joy of the oneness of these three states."}, {"t": 233.94, "end": 235.94, "text": "Turya and Indra-yivritam."}, {"t": 235.94, "end": 238.94, "text": "This is the joy of the oneness of these three states."}, {"t": 238.94, "end": 240.94, "text": "Vigilayata-beda-samskaram,"}, {"t": 240.94, "end": 243.94, "text": "Ananda-rasa-prava-hama-yama-ya-va-pashati,"}, {"t": 243.94, "end": 246.94, "text": "sir-triti-asi-asi-bhokta-jamad-karthar."}, {"t": 246.94, "end": 259.0, "text": "The one who feels these threefold states of Jagara-supanand-sushivati,"}, {"t": 259.0, "end": 267.29, "text": "absolutely away from all dualistic thoughts."}, {"t": 267.29, "end": 269.29, "text": "Vigilayata-beda-samskaram,"}, {"t": 269.29, "end": 272.29, "text": "and filled with Ananda-rasa."}, {"t": 272.29, "end": 275.29, "text": "The flow of Ananda-rasa-prava-hama-yama."}, {"t": 275.29, "end": 283.7, "text": "The one who feels this triple state of Jagara-supanand-sushivati,"}, {"t": 283.7, "end": 289.7, "text": "as one with absolute Turya and Indra-a-chiritam,"}, {"t": 289.7, "end": 293.7, "text": "as mixed,"}, {"t": 293.7, "end": 300.76, "text": "what is the meaning of this?"}, {"t": 300.76, "end": 302.76, "text": "Parvati-not-parvati."}, {"t": 302.76, "end": 304.76, "text": "Parvati-mins."}, {"t": 304.76, "end": 305.76, "text": "Archiritam."}, {"t": 305.76, "end": 311.9, "text": "Archiritam means not deep."}, {"t": 311.9, "end": 313.9, "text": "Mixed."}, {"t": 313.9, "end": 317.9, "text": "Mixed is the real word."}, {"t": 317.9, "end": 319.9, "text": "Mixed."}, {"t": 319.9, "end": 321.9, "text": "Absolutely mixed."}, {"t": 321.9, "end": 323.9, "text": "All-down mixed."}, {"t": 323.9, "end": 332.82, "text": "Then he feels that all these three states are all-down mixed with Turya."}, {"t": 332.82, "end": 337.82, "text": "There was completely prevailed with Turya."}, {"t": 337.82, "end": 340.82, "text": "There is no where there is not Turya."}, {"t": 340.82, "end": 348.6, "text": "By the way of Shakthi Chakra, Anasandana,"}, {"t": 348.6, "end": 351.6, "text": "by the way of meditating on Shakthi Chakra,"}, {"t": 351.6, "end": 355.6, "text": "this is the only way how to reach that state,"}, {"t": 355.6, "end": 360.6, "text": "where these three states are found mixed with that Turya."}, {"t": 360.6, "end": 363.6, "text": "And when they are mixed, Vigilayata-beda-samskaram,"}, {"t": 363.6, "end": 368.6, "text": "all the impressions of dualistic impressions are absolutely destroyed,"}, {"t": 368.6, "end": 371.6, "text": "and Ananda-rasa-prava-hama-yama."}, {"t": 371.6, "end": 380.9, "text": "These three states flow already filled with Ananda-rasa."}, {"t": 380.9, "end": 385.9, "text": "The one who feels that these three states are such."}, {"t": 385.9, "end": 388.9, "text": "So atrati-asi-bhokta,"}, {"t": 388.9, "end": 398.5, "text": "that yogi has really enjoyed in a real way these three states."}, {"t": 398.5, "end": 404.5, "text": "Bhokta-min-chamatkarta has really enjoyed in oneness of awareness."}, {"t": 405.5, "end": 407.5, "text": "Tati-eva,"}, {"t": 407.5, "end": 412.5, "text": "Nisa-patna-sautm-saham-rajo-ayama-paramananda-paripur-no,"}, {"t": 412.5, "end": 414.5, "text": "bhav-beda-grasana,"}, {"t": 414.5, "end": 417.5, "text": "Devan-trashudam-asu-yat-bhok-yama,"}, {"t": 417.5, "end": 419.5, "text": "Bhokta-yash-chip-rakirti-ta,"}, {"t": 419.5, "end": 424.5, "text": "Vedaya-tat-ubhayama-yastu-sab-bunjano-na-li-pete."}, {"t": 424.5, "end": 428.88, "text": "Devan-hu is aware of both,"}, {"t": 428.88, "end": 432.88, "text": "where objectivity exists and where subjectivity exists."}, {"t": 433.88, "end": 437.88, "text": "In these three states of Jagrath-supanand-sosyapati,"}, {"t": 437.88, "end": 445.38, "text": "Trashudam-asu in three states of Jagrath-supanand-sosyapati,"}, {"t": 445.38, "end": 448.38, "text": "where objectivity exists at Bhogam,"}, {"t": 448.38, "end": 450.38, "text": "Bhokta-yash-chiprakirti-ta,"}, {"t": 450.38, "end": 453.38, "text": "and where subjectivity exists."}, {"t": 453.38, "end": 458.38, "text": "You see, can I see a scene object?"}, {"t": 458.38, "end": 460.38, "text": "I see this carpet."}, {"t": 460.38, "end": 461.38, "text": "This is object."}, {"t": 461.38, "end": 464.38, "text": "This carpet is object."}, {"t": 464.38, "end": 468.38, "text": "In this state there is subject also,"}, {"t": 468.38, "end": 471.38, "text": "who feels this carpet."}, {"t": 471.38, "end": 472.38, "text": "This is carpet."}, {"t": 472.38, "end": 475.38, "text": "The one who feels inside within,"}, {"t": 475.38, "end": 476.38, "text": "that this is carpet."}, {"t": 476.38, "end": 478.38, "text": "That is subjectivity."}, {"t": 478.38, "end": 481.38, "text": "And this carpet is objectivity."}, {"t": 481.38, "end": 490.51, "text": "And these two are found in all the three states,"}, {"t": 490.51, "end": 493.51, "text": "in Jagrath-supanand-sosyapati."}, {"t": 494.51, "end": 496.51, "text": "I thought this is Shushyapati."}, {"t": 496.51, "end": 499.51, "text": "No, Shushyapati, there is also object."}, {"t": 499.51, "end": 503.51, "text": "Because he comes out from Shushyapati,"}, {"t": 503.51, "end": 505.51, "text": "out of Shushyapati, he says,"}, {"t": 505.51, "end": 508.51, "text": "God-mudo-ahamas-asu-asam."}, {"t": 508.51, "end": 514.51, "text": "I was asleep perfectly in peace."}, {"t": 514.51, "end": 516.51, "text": "Why that peace was found?"}, {"t": 516.51, "end": 519.51, "text": "Because there was some impression there."}, {"t": 519.51, "end": 522.51, "text": "That wouldn't just be his own nature."}, {"t": 522.51, "end": 523.51, "text": "Now, there is some impression."}, {"t": 523.51, "end": 528.51, "text": "There are some impressions left by that state,"}, {"t": 528.51, "end": 530.51, "text": "where when coming after, after,"}, {"t": 530.51, "end": 532.51, "text": "out of that state,"}, {"t": 532.51, "end": 536.51, "text": "you feel this memory comes in you that"}, {"t": 536.51, "end": 538.51, "text": "you are sleeping very peacefully."}, {"t": 538.51, "end": 540.51, "text": "You don't know anything or anything."}, {"t": 540.51, "end": 542.51, "text": "Within, within."}, {"t": 542.51, "end": 544.51, "text": "Within the state of Shushyapati,"}, {"t": 544.51, "end": 547.51, "text": "how is it possible to differentiate subject and objectivity?"}, {"t": 547.51, "end": 549.51, "text": "Not in Shushyapati, but afterwards."}, {"t": 549.51, "end": 552.51, "text": "Because there are only impressions."}, {"t": 552.51, "end": 555.51, "text": "There is not subject to consciousness there."}, {"t": 555.51, "end": 558.51, "text": "There is impressions of subject to consciousness."}, {"t": 561.51, "end": 568.51, "text": "Those impressions give rise after coming out of that state."}, {"t": 568.51, "end": 570.51, "text": "And in these three states,"}, {"t": 570.51, "end": 574.51, "text": "where object to state exists,"}, {"t": 574.51, "end": 577.51, "text": "and where subject to state exists,"}, {"t": 577.51, "end": 580.51, "text": "where there is no object."}, {"t": 580.51, "end": 582.51, "text": "But the one,"}, {"t": 582.51, "end": 584.51, "text": "the one yogi,"}, {"t": 584.51, "end": 591.72, "text": "who feels these two simultaneously."}, {"t": 591.72, "end": 595.72, "text": "When he feels this carpet,"}, {"t": 595.72, "end": 597.72, "text": "this object,"}, {"t": 597.72, "end": 600.72, "text": "he is unaware of that seer,"}, {"t": 600.72, "end": 602.72, "text": "feeler."}, {"t": 602.72, "end": 605.72, "text": "But he must be the one who is aware"}, {"t": 605.72, "end": 608.72, "text": "at the same time, aware of that feeler also."}, {"t": 608.72, "end": 613.77, "text": "At the time of perceiving this object,"}, {"t": 613.77, "end": 615.77, "text": "the one who is aware of it both."}, {"t": 615.77, "end": 617.77, "text": "himself and what he is experiencing."}, {"t": 617.77, "end": 618.77, "text": "Yes."}, {"t": 618.77, "end": 620.77, "text": "Serbhundanonadipiti."}, {"t": 620.77, "end": 628.03, "text": "He does not get stained or polluted in that."}, {"t": 628.03, "end": 629.03, "text": "Never."}, {"t": 629.03, "end": 631.03, "text": "In those experiences."}, {"t": 631.03, "end": 632.03, "text": "Yes."}, {"t": 632.03, "end": 634.03, "text": "He is above that."}, {"t": 634.03, "end": 641.03, "text": "Huh?"}, {"t": 641.03, "end": 643.03, "text": "They don't vanish."}, {"t": 643.03, "end": 647.92, "text": "They become one with that scream being."}, {"t": 647.92, "end": 648.92, "text": "Yes."}, {"t": 648.92, "end": 657.09, "text": "So, this kind of yogi is"}, {"t": 657.09, "end": 659.09, "text": "Nisapatna saatna saamraja."}, {"t": 659.09, "end": 661.09, "text": "He does hold the"}, {"t": 661.09, "end": 665.09, "text": "animalist kingdom of universal self."}, {"t": 665.09, "end": 670.59, "text": "Nisapatna means enemy less."}, {"t": 670.59, "end": 672.59, "text": "And raiva."}, {"t": 672.59, "end": 677.28, "text": "And the kingdom of, huh?"}, {"t": 677.28, "end": 679.28, "text": "So, this day, he doesn't,"}, {"t": 679.28, "end": 680.28, "text": "in this question,"}, {"t": 680.28, "end": 681.28, "text": "she was asking about,"}, {"t": 681.28, "end": 682.28, "text": "this merges into,"}, {"t": 682.28, "end": 683.28, "text": "there's only seeing."}, {"t": 683.28, "end": 685.28, "text": "It's not simply only seeing."}, {"t": 685.28, "end": 687.28, "text": "Although the object itself may become"}, {"t": 687.28, "end": 688.28, "text": "the zero."}, {"t": 688.28, "end": 689.28, "text": "No."}, {"t": 689.28, "end": 691.28, "text": "Objection, subject are one."}, {"t": 691.28, "end": 692.28, "text": "Yes, are one."}, {"t": 692.28, "end": 694.28, "text": "But you still experience."}, {"t": 694.28, "end": 696.28, "text": "You experience in one that, in one being."}, {"t": 696.28, "end": 697.28, "text": "Yes."}, {"t": 697.28, "end": 698.28, "text": "In one being."}, {"t": 698.28, "end": 699.28, "text": "But you still don't lose."}, {"t": 699.28, "end": 700.28, "text": "I mean, there's still."}, {"t": 700.28, "end": 701.28, "text": "You don't lose action."}, {"t": 701.28, "end": 702.28, "text": "You don't lose action."}, {"t": 702.28, "end": 705.28, "text": "You do whatever everybody does."}, {"t": 705.28, "end": 706.28, "text": "At the same time."}, {"t": 706.28, "end": 708.28, "text": "And you are above that."}, {"t": 708.28, "end": 712.62, "text": "Paramahananda Paripurna."}, {"t": 712.62, "end": 714.62, "text": "He is filled with supreme ananda."}, {"t": 716.9, "end": 719.9, "text": "And he becomes master of viras,"}, {"t": 719.9, "end": 723.9, "text": "heroes, who are bent upon destroying this"}, {"t": 723.9, "end": 725.9, "text": "differentiatedness of universe."}, {"t": 725.9, "end": 727.9, "text": "Bhavaya, the Grasana Pravana Ananda."}, {"t": 727.9, "end": 730.9, "text": "Bhavaya, that means differentiatedness of universal"}, {"t": 730.9, "end": 732.9, "text": "differentiatedness."}, {"t": 732.9, "end": 735.9, "text": "Differentiatedness of universe."}, {"t": 735.9, "end": 737.9, "text": "Who are bent upon,"}, {"t": 737.9, "end": 738.9, "text": "Grasana Pravana Ananda."}, {"t": 738.9, "end": 740.9, "text": "Pravana Ananda means bent upon."}, {"t": 740.9, "end": 744.9, "text": "Grasana means bent upon destroying and digesting."}, {"t": 745.9, "end": 746.9, "text": "Yes."}, {"t": 746.9, "end": 752.5, "text": "The differentiatedness of world."}, {"t": 752.5, "end": 754.5, "text": "And those are viras."}, {"t": 754.5, "end": 755.5, "text": "Viras means Indrayas."}, {"t": 755.5, "end": 756.5, "text": "Indra-Shaktis."}, {"t": 756.5, "end": 758.5, "text": "The energies of organs."}, {"t": 758.5, "end": 761.5, "text": "Not the vrittis of organs."}, {"t": 761.5, "end": 765.5, "text": "He becomes master of those."}, {"t": 765.5, "end": 766.5, "text": "In other words,"}, {"t": 766.5, "end": 768.5, "text": "Sri Manthana Bhairav Sathana Prashto,"}, {"t": 768.5, "end": 771.5, "text": "Mahamna Aishu Ujjade."}, {"t": 771.5, "end": 775.5, "text": "He is named nominated as Manthana Bhairava."}, {"t": 776.5, "end": 778.5, "text": "One with Manthana Bhairava."}, {"t": 778.5, "end": 783.73, "text": "Manthana Bhairava means"}, {"t": 783.73, "end": 785.73, "text": "who moves,"}, {"t": 785.73, "end": 788.73, "text": "who churns everything."}, {"t": 788.73, "end": 791.73, "text": "Who churns everything in one consciousness."}, {"t": 791.73, "end": 797.98, "text": "And you get the supreme mixture out of you."}, {"t": 797.98, "end": 799.98, "text": "Then there is a mixture."}, {"t": 799.98, "end": 802.98, "text": "So there is no differentiatedness of objects,"}, {"t": 802.98, "end": 805.98, "text": "object and cognitive world."}, {"t": 805.98, "end": 807.98, "text": "Nothing remains."}, {"t": 807.98, "end": 810.98, "text": "Only it means one mixed."}, {"t": 810.98, "end": 814.98, "text": "One mixed dose of universal consciousness."}, {"t": 814.98, "end": 818.38, "text": "Because it is churned."}, {"t": 818.38, "end": 821.38, "text": "That is Parmeshiva does that."}, {"t": 821.38, "end": 823.38, "text": "Parmeshiva or yogi?"}, {"t": 823.38, "end": 826.38, "text": "yogi is one with Parmeshiva."}, {"t": 826.38, "end": 833.38, "text": "And it is so explained in very rare tantras."}, {"t": 833.38, "end": 835.38, "text": "Mahamna Aishu Ujjade."}, {"t": 835.38, "end": 836.38, "text": "Yes."}, {"t": 837.38, "end": 839.38, "text": "On the other hand,"}, {"t": 839.38, "end": 841.38, "text": "the one who is not,"}, {"t": 841.38, "end": 843.38, "text": "who is not such."}, {"t": 843.38, "end": 846.38, "text": "Sir Jagaradyavastya Bhir Bhujamana."}, {"t": 846.38, "end": 849.38, "text": "He is played by these three states"}, {"t": 849.38, "end": 851.38, "text": "of Jagarath Sopanand Sushavati."}, {"t": 851.38, "end": 854.38, "text": "Laukika, he is as good as ordinary,"}, {"t": 854.38, "end": 855.38, "text": "samsaric,"}, {"t": 855.38, "end": 857.38, "text": "worldly man,"}, {"t": 857.38, "end": 858.38, "text": "Pashoreva."}, {"t": 858.38, "end": 860.38, "text": "He is as good as."}, {"t": 860.38, "end": 861.38, "text": "Pashoreva."}, {"t": 861.38, "end": 865.38, "text": "Pashoreva means beast."}, {"t": 865.38, "end": 869.38, "text": "Yogipi, Yamam Dharam, Anadirudha."}, {"t": 869.38, "end": 873.38, "text": "Yogi also, who has not achieved,"}, {"t": 873.38, "end": 878.38, "text": "who has not attained this supreme submit of consciousness."}, {"t": 878.38, "end": 880.38, "text": "He is not Vireshura."}, {"t": 880.38, "end": 882.38, "text": "He is, he too is not Vireshura."}, {"t": 882.38, "end": 885.38, "text": "On the other hand, Mudeva."}, {"t": 885.38, "end": 892.8, "text": "He is also as good as Pashoreva."}, {"t": 892.8, "end": 893.8, "text": "Aetachya,"}, {"t": 893.8, "end": 897.46, "text": "Aetadynasi, Svachanda Shastrasya,"}, {"t": 897.46, "end": 899.46, "text": "Vedate darsitam."}, {"t": 900.46, "end": 903.46, "text": "This kind of explanation is very well explained"}, {"t": 903.46, "end": 906.46, "text": "in Svachanda Shastra, etc."}, {"t": 906.46, "end": 908.46, "text": "Yogis, Svachanda Yogena,"}, {"t": 908.46, "end": 910.46, "text": "Svachanda Gati Chayarena,"}, {"t": 910.46, "end": 913.46, "text": "Svachanda Padaya Yukta, Svachanda Samata Amraji."}, {"t": 913.46, "end": 919.54, "text": "The yogi, who has adopted"}, {"t": 919.54, "end": 922.54, "text": "the yoga independent yoga,"}, {"t": 922.54, "end": 925.54, "text": "and Svachanda Gati Chayarena."}, {"t": 925.54, "end": 928.54, "text": "And by that independent yoga,"}, {"t": 928.54, "end": 935.54, "text": "he is moving in an independent way"}, {"t": 935.54, "end": 940.54, "text": "and is situated in independent state"}, {"t": 940.54, "end": 948.49, "text": "and gets entry in independent way."}, {"t": 948.49, "end": 950.49, "text": "Svachanda Samata Amraji."}, {"t": 950.49, "end": 952.49, "text": "Aetadynasi, Svachanda Shastrasya,"}, {"t": 952.49, "end": 953.49, "text": "Vedate darsitam."}, {"t": 953.49, "end": 956.49, "text": "This is explained in such a way in Svachanda."}, {"t": 956.49, "end": 958.49, "text": "In Svanda,"}, {"t": 958.49, "end": 961.49, "text": "this kind of explanation is explained in this yoga,"}, {"t": 961.49, "end": 963.49, "text": "Tashopalabdi Sadatam,"}, {"t": 963.49, "end": 968.91, "text": "Tripada-Vibhi Chayarena."}, {"t": 968.91, "end": 971.91, "text": "The knowledge of that Svanda"}, {"t": 971.91, "end": 976.91, "text": "is held by him in Jagrath,"}, {"t": 976.91, "end": 979.91, "text": "in Sopun and in Sushavati,"}, {"t": 979.91, "end": 984.61, "text": "same, in the same manner."}, {"t": 984.61, "end": 986.61, "text": "In Jagrath, it is not less."}, {"t": 986.61, "end": 988.61, "text": "In Sopna, it is not lesser."}, {"t": 988.61, "end": 990.61, "text": "In Sushavati, it is not more,"}, {"t": 990.61, "end": 991.61, "text": "most less."}, {"t": 991.61, "end": 992.61, "text": "It is same."}, {"t": 992.61, "end": 995.61, "text": "He feels that the state of Turya is found,"}, {"t": 995.61, "end": 1007.14, "text": "is completely takes place in all the three states."}, {"t": 1007.14, "end": 1009.14, "text": "Thus,"}]}